WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.610
It's Saturday, and this is the Microsoft for Education Daily.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.920
Here's what shipped at Microsoft in the last 24 hours.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.520
Plan ahead. Microsoft 365 Education is getting a new lineup, from A0 to A7.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:26.890
Most of it lands at your first renewal on or after January 2028.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.830
For teachers, Microsoft Classroom is coming, with assignments,

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:39.090
grades, Class Notebook, Teach and Study and Learn.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.220
From 2028, A0 gives students Office,

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:46.730
Minecraft Education and Learning Zone, at no extra cost.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:47.750
And in December,

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:52.240
Learning Zone should show teachers where a class is struggling, lesson by lesson.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.260
Squinting at a shared slide in Teams?

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.410
Pinch to zoom on your touchpad is rolling out now.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.020
Campus IT? The top tier, A7, adds Copilot, Agent 365 and Entra Suite.

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:10.570
Faculty get Defender for Office 365 in A3,

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:14.120
and Intune Suite in A5, at no extra cost.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.010
Code on GitHub?

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:22.300
Microsoft saw an AI agent go from spotting leaked keys to taking vault data in five minutes.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:27.440
Run university websites? Azure Front Door can now use post-quantum key exchange,

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.350
to prepare for future threats.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.850
Storage changes too: the 100 TB base allocation goes,

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:36.900
and each paid license adds space instead.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.690
And Purview is due to let admins trim old file versions kept by retention,

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:43.220
with a preview this month.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.550
The fine print? Office 365 A1,

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:52.830
the Student Use Benefit and free alumni email retire in 2028.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:56.420
Patch Paint from the Microsoft Store: the fix for i

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:59.460
ts remote code flaw reportedly skips Windows Update.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:04.240
After hours? In Hope in the City,

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:07.680
a sketchbook holds the clues, from November 11.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:11.450
Need a calmer night? Hozy has no timers,

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:14.610
no scores and no stress, from November 9.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.000
And Shrek 2 Remastered lands November 10: play solo,

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.240
or with up to three friends.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.240
New plans, new tools, new dates: whatever your school runs,

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:28.330
the smart move is to plan ahead.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.350
Zoom out, and it never stops shipping.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.690
On the release board: shipped, and still shipping.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.410
That was 24 hours at Microsoft. Tomorrow, there's more.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.870
You've been watching the Microsoft for Education Daily.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.310
Stay curious. See you tomorrow.
